{
    "info": {
        "name": "Stickers & Labels - box sticker + location labels",
        "_postman_id": "7f3a1c62-5b0e-4d18-9a44-2c6b8e0d1f33",
        "description": "Everything that prints a code: the box sticker on an SPI, and the four\nlocation labels.\n\nALL of these are tenant-scoped and need {{token}}. Set it as a collection\nvariable or in an environment before sending - without it the request is\nrefused by auth:sanctum, which surfaces as a 500 (\"Route [login] not\ndefined\") rather than a 401, because this app has no login route to\nredirect to.\n\nBOX STICKER\n  /p2p/spi/{id}/boxes/{box}/sticker/download   the printable A4 PDF.\n  Not read-only: it stamps sticker_printed_at the first time it is\n  pulled and writes a sticker_printed activity.\n\nLOCATION LABELS - warehouse, zone, rack, shelf\n  /preview  JSON for the on-screen modal (includes qr + download_url)\n  /label    the printable A4 PDF\n  /qr       the bare PNG, for a screen that places it itself\n\nThe label leads with what it is, carries its handling flags (COLD CHAIN,\nHAZARDOUS, INACTIVE, or NORMAL) in the header, and prints the FULL\nADDRESS IN IDS across its foot - a shelf shows WAREHOUSE / ZONE / RACK /\nSHELF, because \"SH-003\" alone names a shelf in every warehouse the\nclient has.",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "variable": [
        {
            "key": "baseUrl",
            "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000",
            "type": "string"
        },
        {
            "key": "spiId",
            "value": "3",
            "type": "string"
        },
        {
            "key": "boxId",
            "value": "30",
            "type": "string"
        },
        {
            "key": "token",
            "value": "",
            "type": "string"
        },
        {
            "key": "warehouseId",
            "value": "1",
            "type": "string"
        },
        {
            "key": "zoneId",
            "value": "1",
            "type": "string"
        },
        {
            "key": "rackId",
            "value": "1",
            "type": "string"
        },
        {
            "key": "shelfId",
            "value": "1",
            "type": "string"
        }
    ],
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "01 - The real label (needs auth)",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Download a real box sticker",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Authorization",
                                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/pdf"
                            }
                        ],
                        "description": "The production endpoint, for comparison against the preview.\n\nStamps sticker_printed_at the first time it is pulled and logs a sticker_printed activity - it is not a read-only call.\n\nTenant-scoped: set {{token}} to a user of the client that owns {{spiId}}.",
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/p2p/spi/{{spiId}}/boxes/{{boxId}}/sticker/download",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "p2p",
                                "spi",
                                "{{spiId}}",
                                "boxes",
                                "{{boxId}}",
                                "sticker",
                                "download"
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    "response": []
                }
            ]
        },
        {
